# Tech stack — portfolio

## Stack

- Create React App (`react-scripts` 3.x), React 16, React Router 5.
- Deploy: GitHub Pages (`homepage: "."`, `gh-pages` branch).
- Styled-components theme + shared CSS tokens (`src/styles/tokens.css`).

## Performance budget (targets)

- Prefer self-hosted fonts (`@fontsource`) over extra Google Fonts requests.
- Remove unused CDN scripts from `public/index.html` (legacy anime/canvas/iconify).
- Code-split secondary routes with `React.lazy` + `Suspense`.
- Lazy-load images below the fold (`loading="lazy"`).
- Avoid adding Three.js, heavy chart libs, or duplicate animation libraries unless strictly required.

## Structure

- Calm shell: `components/calmLayout/CalmLayout.js`.
- Token-based styles: `tokens.css`, `calm-surface.css`, `calm-page.css`.
- Content source of truth: `src/portfolio.js` (export data only; avoid hardcoding copy in components).
